  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut cauliflower into small florets.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.\n• Place cauliflower and snacking tomatoes on a lined oven tray. Add a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper and toss to combine.\n• Spread out evenly, then roast until tender blistered, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68199017d15aa7b407b7536b/step-feb2e800.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large saucepan, add the water and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 minutes.\n• Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68199017d15aa7b407b7536b/step-f63d9410.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the couscous is cooking, finely chop garlic.\n• In a small bowl, combine the honey, a splash of hot water and dried oregano (see ingredients).\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and garlic over medium-high heat. Cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Transfer to a second small bowl.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt to garlic oil mixture and combine. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68199017d15aa7b407b7536b/step-36eadb20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then add honey glaze, turning haloumi to coat until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68199017d15aa7b407b7536b/step-99eb9130.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, to the pan with couscous, add roasted veggies, baby spinach leaves and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Toss to combine and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68199017d15aa7b407b7536b/step-dd00c340.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veg couscous between bowls. Top with honey-glazed haloumi.\n• Dollop garlic yoghurt and sprinkle over everything garnish to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68199017d15aa7b407b7536b/step-85b2dc50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
